      "writtenOn": "2023-02-22T01:48:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The command is executed through `trunks_send` which gets parsed as a string. `trunks_send` appends a `\\n` that gets stripped in ts_read at line 614. The bugger needs to be big enough for 2K of data and what trunks appends.",
